<% layout('layout/boilerplate') %>

<div class="container-xl py-5" style="max-width: 860px;">
  <!-- Terms Header -->
  <div class="pb-4 mb-4 border-bottom">
    <span class="badge bg-secondary bg-opacity-10 text-dark rounded-pill px-3 py-1 fw-bold text-uppercase mb-2" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">
      Legal
    </span>
    <h1 class="display-6 fw-bold mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-secondary small mb-0">Effective date: October 2026</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="lh-lg text-secondary">
    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">1. Agreement to Terms</h5>
    <p>By accessing or using YelpCamp, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree with any of these terms, you are prohibited from using this site.</p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3 mt-4">2. Host and Listing Responsibilities</h5>
    <p>As a host listing a campground, you represent and warrant that your listing accurately depicts the property, amenities, accessibility, and nightly pricing. You are responsible for ensuring your campsite complies with all local zoning, safety, and fire ordinances.</p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3 mt-4">3. Camper Code of Conduct</h5>
    <p>All campers must follow outdoor safety rules, practice <strong>Leave No Trace</strong> ethics, respect quiet hours, properly extinguish campfires, and leave campsites clean.</p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3 mt-4">4. Reviews & Community Guidelines</h5>
    <p>Reviews must reflect genuine first-hand experiences. We reserve the right to remove reviews that contain abusive language, spam, or false claims.</p>

